  "scenes": [
    {
      "caption": "StatePort starts with named applications, not a blank chat. This private-alpha fixture shows ongoing work with its own purpose, durable state, decisions, and history.",
      "endSeconds": 11.088,
      "id": "scene-01",
      "image": "assets/media/stateport-demo-home.png",
      "imageSha256": "3617f096e0eac220bfc99a685e005e89b8def00bb26d58289e3ed9ed7f64ca07",
      "startSeconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "caption": "The application plane provides purpose and continuity. StatePort owns intent, authority, canonical state, evidence, and acceptance. Those facts do not belong to an agent session.",
      "endSeconds": 23.874,
      "id": "scene-02",
      "image": "assets/media/stateport-demo-home.png",
      "imageSha256": "3617f096e0eac220bfc99a685e005e89b8def00bb26d58289e3ed9ed7f64ca07",
      "startSeconds": 11.538
    },
    {
      "caption": "Conversation is one view inside the application. The execution plane is separate: the harness runs an authorized task and returns observations and candidate output, but it does not own accepted state.",
      "endSeconds": 37.106,
      "id": "scene-03",
      "image": "assets/media/stateport-demo-conversation.png",
      "imageSha256": "056c40e2ef5d19c64d73729f4f4c21f8647c5d47b347c46e993e38dceb95833a",
      "startSeconds": 24.338
    },
    {
      "caption": "The source view says whether an application source is verified. A development candidate can provide isolated-test evidence, but it does not silently become a canonical release or production install.",
      "endSeconds": 49.259,
      "id": "scene-04",
      "image": "assets/media/stateport-demo-source.png",
      "imageSha256": "8f98c600ededf4afd2ef4d6e4594298533f223531e49d8019a24048e26666f9a",
      "startSeconds": 37.571
    },
    {
      "caption": "The same application list remains readable on a small screen. This is a local interface view, not evidence of a separate mobile release.",
      "endSeconds": 57.989,
      "id": "scene-05",
      "image": "assets/media/stateport-demo-mobile.png",
      "imageSha256": "e8ae632b5a05714874f89800b7bbc6e70fea22a46f217c6cad684c31b0a8e8ed",
      "startSeconds": 49.709
    },
    {
      "caption": "This private alpha has one exercised provider path: Codex in supervised-direct mode. Other providers are not qualified by this walkthrough, and there is no public software download yet.",
